# Terraform working dir, state and credentials. terraform.tfvars holds the
# Proxmox API password, the LXC root password and your SSH key — it must never
# be committed. Keep terraform.tfvars.example (which holds no secrets) tracked.
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/*.tfstate
terraform/*.tfstate.*
terraform/crash.log
terraform.tfvars

# Ansible
*.retry
.vault_pass
